# Daily comment digest (src/notify). Sent via a dedicated Gmail bot account:
#   1. Create a new Gmail account for this project (e.g. aquinas-pipeline-bot@gmail.com).
#   2. Enable 2-Step Verification on it (required for App Passwords).
#   3. Google Account -> Security -> 2-Step Verification -> App passwords -> create one.
#   4. SMTP_USER / MAIL_FROM = that Gmail address; SMTP_PASS = the 16-char App Password
#      (not the account's login password).
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=
SMTP_PASS=
MAIL_FROM=
PUBLIC_BASE_URL=
